      "description": "LogQL counts error-level records by the bounded Loki service label. Incident answered: which runtime service is producing errors, and when did the error rate start?\n\n```logql\nsum by (service_name) (count_over_time({compose_project=\"ascendance-social\", service_name=~\"$service\", level=\"error\"}[$__interval]))\n```",
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "color": {
            "mode": "palette-classic"
          },
          "custom": {
            "axisColorMode": "text",
            "axisLabel": "",
            "axisPlacement": "auto",
            "barAlignment": 0,
